WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,084 --> 00:00:03,601
Welcome back to Cloud Town, high up in the sky!

2
00:00:03,651 --> 00:00:05,965
This is Episode 42.

3
00:00:06,015 --> 00:00:08,218
The whole class wants in.

4
00:00:08,268 --> 00:00:11,137
Three little sparks at the yellow door.

5
00:00:11,187 --> 00:00:13,324
The door list says may.

6
00:00:13,374 --> 00:00:14,788
They push.

7
00:00:14,838 --> 00:00:16,509
It stays shut.

8
00:00:16,559 --> 00:00:17,841
Oh no!

9
00:00:17,891 --> 00:00:19,572
Maya points up.

10
00:00:19,622 --> 00:00:22,879
High above every door is the principal's rule.

11
00:00:22,929 --> 00:00:25,077
One big red cross.

12
00:00:25,127 --> 00:00:27,396
The class list says may.

13
00:00:27,446 --> 00:00:29,727
The principal says may not.

14
00:00:29,777 --> 00:00:31,680
The principal wins.

15
00:00:31,730 --> 00:00:33,212
Every time.

16
00:00:33,262 --> 00:00:35,698
The rule never opens a door.

17
00:00:35,748 --> 00:00:37,784
It only closes one.

18
00:00:37,834 --> 00:00:40,059
A ceiling, not a key.

19
00:00:40,109 --> 00:00:42,634
The sparks zip to the blue door.

20
00:00:42,684 --> 00:00:44,932
The rule says nothing there.

21
00:00:44,982 --> 00:00:46,164
Green!

22
00:00:46,214 --> 00:00:48,017
It swings open.

23
00:00:48,067 --> 00:00:49,493
In they go.

24
00:00:49,543 --> 00:00:51,779
That is the principal's rule.

25
00:00:51,829 --> 00:00:54,032
Now you know SCP!

26
00:00:54,082 --> 00:00:58,000
See you next time in Cloud Town, high up in the sky!
